  "kind": "randomized_experiment",
  "statement": "Treatment was randomly assigned within each pooled incrementality test, so per-arm probabilities and their difference given pre-treatment features are experimentally identified intention-to-treat effects (provided the features capture test membership). Treatment ratios differ slightly between the pooled tests (propensity AUC 0.509, max |SMD| 0.048), so the pooled difference in means is not an unbiased average effect; standardised estimates are in post_fit_diagnostics. Exposure is not randomized; the complier (exposure) effect is a Wald estimate under the exclusion restriction.",
